    f27_manual_continuation_riscv_formal_overlay_workaround_2026-11-22, 0, "Phase 3 build f27 required a manual 10-module continuation overlay using release riscv_formal.spl because the base lacked a679b749ff6; even after merging a679b749ff6 and 0b8f0f43060, consumers kept split-brain bare hardware.riscv_common imports, unused runner imports, and missing pub visibility on riscv_formal and verify_qemu_formal_output."

