bug_investigation_logs |bug_id, line_num, content|
    f27_manual_continuation_riscv_formal_overlay_workaround_2026-11-22, 0, "2026-11-27 W8-5: Confirmed a679b749ff6 and 0b8f0f43060 are ancestors of release/1.0.0 with no residual overlay/workaround scripts in tree. Fixed remaining root-cause drift: switched 4 os/lib consumers from bare hardware.riscv_common.core.riscv_formal to std.hardware.riscv_common.core.riscv_formal, removed 4 unused bare imports in src/os/_QemuRunner/{runner_targets,scenario_catalog,scenario_disks,scenario_exec}.spl, added pub fn visibility to 5 functions in src/lib/hardware/riscv_common/core/riscv_formal.spl and verify_qemu_formal_output in src/os/_QemuRunner/os_build_run.spl + src/os/qemu_runner_part2.spl, and pruned 5 resolved rows from scripts/check/private_import_baseline.txt. Added test/01_unit/hardware/riscv_common/riscv_formal_lib_overlay_spec.spl and test/01_unit/os/riscv_formal_overlay_regression_spec.spl. Direct simple.exe run smoke on std.hardware.riscv_common.core.riscv_formal passed (SEED_RUN_PASS, RUN_EXIT=0); simple.exe test on both specs failed pre-execution in the 2026-11-19 Windows seed binary on @representation_boundary in std.spec -> file_bytes.spl (bin/release/x86_64-pc-windows-msvc/simple.exe absent on host; stage3 native-build hit cold-hir-module-source-mismatch). Waiting-for: current self-hosted CLI sspec pass and Phase 3->3 verification."
